{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>入去聽周洪賓唱歌!10.25 DJ 派對</p><p>Jacomax任食Pizza×DJ派對</p><p>人氣薄餅店Jacomax又有新搞作！今個周末10月25日舉辦任食Pizza×DJ派對，邀請了 DJ FUNGMADE &amp; DJ MOLLY 現場打碟，屆時老闆兼著名 YouTuber 周洪賓仲會獻唱高歌一曲，一定笑爆全場！早鳥價$349(原價 $399）可以任食多款人氣手工Pizza 、以及任飲精選 Cocktail及飲品，名額有限，組隊去狂歡啦～</p><p>活動詳情 日期：10月25日 13:00 – 16:00 地點：JACOMAX 銅鑼灣FASHION WALK 門票：早鳥價 $349（原價 $399）</p><p>購票及詳情： https://inline.app/event/inline-vas-presents/pizzarave/jacomax 官方IG：@jacomax_pizza @jacopo_only_friends</p><p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256245605567995_20699074586ad8551834301.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256245747358143_5424041356ad85519afd5a.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256245933894595_17555762566ad8551b94586.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256246143682413_3928531356ad8551d980d4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256246292325157_18973269296ad8551f1e69d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179256246452989734_6236440236ad85520b3331.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T06:20:46.869946+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":564,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T06:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T07:57:46.968970+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T06:17:41.350282+00:00","content_hash"